s://github.com/quic-go/quic-go/pull/5947)\r\n* http3: `Stream.ReceiveDatagram` and `RequestStream.ReceiveDatagram` now fail immediately if the context is already canceled: [#5948](https://github.com/quic-go/quic-go/pull/5948)\r\n* Stream reset handling now ignores reliable boundary updates after cancellation: [#5950](https://github.com/quic-go/quic-go/pull/5950)\r\n\r\n## Changelog\r\n* ignore reliable boundary updates after stream cancellation by @marten-seemann in https://github.com/quic-go/quic-go/pull/5950\r\n* fail Conn.ReceiveDatagram if the context is already canceled by @marten-seemann in https://github.com/quic-go/quic-go/pull/5947\r\n* http3: fail Stream.ReceiveDatagram if the context is already canceled by @marten-seemann in https://github.com/quic-go/quic-go/pull/5948\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/quic-go/quic-go/compare/v0.64.0...v0.64.1","mentions_count":1}
